   "skos:definition": "Social psychologist and Columbia Business School professor whose 2001 experiments with Thomas Mussweiler established the first-offer advantage in negotiation, whose 2008 studies separated perspective-taking from empathy at the bargaining table, and who popularised the \"range of acceptable behavior\" idea for speaking up.",
