   },
   "skos:definition": "The recurring situation of telling someone about an outcome that will disappoint, worry or cost them - a cancelled project, a rejected proposal, a missed deadline, a layoff, a price rise. It goes best when the messenger prepares, states the news early and plainly, makes room for the reaction, and ends with what happens next.",
